<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar committee to set molasses duties.</title>
<headline>EU sugar committee to set molasses duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will on Wednesday fix the reference prices for imports of cane and beet molasses, an EU offical said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee will fix the reference prices but there is not expected to be any change in the duties,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>Last week the committee fixed the duty for cane molasses at 0.41 Ecus per 100 kg and the duty for beet molasses at zero. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
